The first weeks at Halcenvane. Four tracks, each decided on paper. Triage is new and untested. Brom's Blade-cohort assessment is the ninth. Lira must register for the ladder by the fourteenth and has not. The entry demonstration is not yet scheduled. Cael's leading hip is still settling from Edran.

